OL,3,GNEWSABridleways to reopen but landowner
OL,4,Ais concerned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to give horse riders the
OL,7,Fright to use established routes has
OL,8,Fbeen met with caution by landowners who
OL,9,Fown a large part of the area.
OL,11,FRaby Estates said it would add to
OL,12,F"visitor pressures" around The Wrekin
OL,13,Fand the permission would need to be
OL,14,F"managed carefully and sensitively".
OL,16,FThe decision to open up the bridleways
OL,17,Fcame after a public inquiry in
OL,18,FSeptember and Sally-Anne Robinson, of
OL,19,FTelford Bridleways Association, said it
OL,20,Fwas "the biggest bridleway gain ever in
OL,21,FShropshire".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
